# 🔥 1️⃣9️⃣ Train Formula

### Opposite direction:

$$
\boxed{
T=\frac{L_1+L_2}{S_1+S_2}
}
$$

### Same direction:

$$
\boxed{
T=\frac{L_1+L_2}{|S_1-S_2|}
}
$$

