# 2️⃣4️⃣ Important Aptitude Trick

For fixed distance:

```text
Speed ↑
   ↓
Time ↓
```

For fixed time:

```text
Speed ↑
   ↓
Distance ↑
```

This helps identify whether a problem is direct or inverse.

