# ⚡ 2️⃣7️⃣ Quick MCQ Shortcuts

### If distance is same:

$$
\boxed{S\propto1/T}
$$

### If time is same:

$$
\boxed{D\propto S}
$$

### Opposite direction:

$$
\boxed{S_{rel}=S_1+S_2}
$$

### Same direction:

$$
\boxed{S_{rel}=|S_1-S_2|}
$$

### Equal distance:

$$
\boxed{\frac{2ab}{a+b}}
$$

### Train + pole:

$$
\boxed{\frac{L}{S}}
$$

### Train + platform:

$$
\boxed{\frac{L+P}{S}}
$$

### Boats:

$$
\boxed{D=B+S}
$$

$$
\boxed{U=B-S}
$$

