# 🧠 TODAY'S FORMULA CARD

```text
Speed = Distance / Time

Distance = Speed × Time

Time = Distance / Speed

km/h → m/s = ×5/18

m/s → km/h = ×18/5

Opposite relative speed = S₁ + S₂

Same-direction relative speed = |S₁ − S₂|

Equal-distance average speed = 2ab/(a+b)

Equal-time average speed = (a+b)/2

Train + pole = L/S

Train + platform = (L+P)/S

Boats:
Downstream = B+S
Upstream = B−S

Boat = (D+U)/2

Stream = (D−U)/2
```

