```text
             TIME-SPEED-DISTANCE
                     │
          ┌──────────┼──────────┐
          ↓          ↓          ↓
       Basic      Relative    Average
          │          │          │
        D=ST       Opposite    Equal D
                   → ADD       → 2ab/a+b
                   Same        Equal T
                   → SUB       → a+b/2
          │
          ├───────────────┐
